# wear/man/robe_sleeve_l: the wide sleeve of the robe and the kaftan: the cuff (the arm library's cuff region in the trim
# colour) flaring a pixel at the wrist; keys the overlay lacks fall back to the plain trimmed cuff (left arm), drawn over the arm library's keys
# GARB-M (P2b wave 2). Drafted from arms/adult/loco/man_l.pxm by recolouring its sleeve rows, then hand-checked composed.
use person woman
legend Z linen 4
legend W metal2 0
body man
role garment robe
role garment kaftan
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys armL
side L
z 1
tags overlay

